  "description": "RoadMance is built for riders who enjoy going a little further, whether that means smooth tarmac, rough backroads, gravel paths, or multi-day bikepacking trips. Designed with stable handling and long-distance comfort in mind, it feels confident on uneven terrain while still remaining efficient and easy to ride on the road.\n\nWith generous tire clearance for up to 29x2.3\" or 27.5x2.4\" tires, RoadMance adapts easily to different riding styles and terrain choices. The seamless heat-treated multi-butted MKPT chromoly tubing keeps a balanced ride feel with the durability steel is known for.\n\nPaired with the No.88 carbon fork featuring mounts for cages, racks, and fenders, the bike is ready for commuting, touring, or off-road exploration without needing much extra thought.\n\nDetails like stealth dropper routing, top tube bag mounts, and ED black coating inside and out help keep the bike practical, clean-looking, and durable for long-term use.\n\nThe longer reach and moderate stack height give RoadMance a natural riding position with either drop bars or flat bars, depending on how you want to build it.\n\nSimple, capable, and adaptable, RoadMance is made for riders who enjoy the freedom of taking the longer route home.",
